The matrix count facade retains bindings' immutable exact count owner and source evidence, uses checked signed integer arithmetic, validates each actual result domain and explicit capacity, and retains both original operands of an explicit exact ratio. Continuous expectations and standard uncertainty remain independently typed continuous quantities. This implements the finite exact subset of (`rule:nrz:quantity-heap-counts`) at (`[BINDINGS-rule:bindings:count-descriptor]`), (`[MATRIX-def:matrix:exact-count-quantity]`), (`[MATRIX-rule:matrix:exact-count-arithmetic]`), (`[MATRIX-rule:matrix:exact-count-ratio]`), with measured caller Work in (`[MATRIX-ex:matrix:quantity-count-work]`).

